/em><\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-582795497 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(255,255,255);\n}\n#text-582795497 > * {\n  color: rgb(255,255,255);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_1662808928 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(55, 51, 51);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1487255461\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-158803302\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-1521694979\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1839176618\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1552387042\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1386\" height=\"1386\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2.png 1386w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-800x800.png 800w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/How-do-Kiierr-laser-caps-work-so-well-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1386px) 100vw, 1386px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_1552387042 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-729040721\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1124726390\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>The Kiierr laser cap technology works to turn back the aging clock. Miniaturization of the hair follicle is a naturally occurring phenomenon during which, over the course of a human\u2019s life, the hair follicle weakens with each hair cycle. The follicle produces increasingly thinner hair until it dies and ceases to produce any hair at all.<\/p>\n<p>Low light laser therapy has demonstrated, scientifically, that it effectively stimulates and energizes the cells within the hair follicle, renewing and strengthening the follicle. The exciting result for you is noticeably thicker, healthier hair.<\/p>\n<p>While there may not yet be a cure for hair loss, <strong>Kiierr has developed the technology to safely, effectively treat and promote new hair growth.<\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1124726390 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1124726390 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-284587836\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-479712322\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<a class=\"button primary lowercase dfsetre\"  style=\"border-radius:99px;\">\n\t\t<span>GET YOURS TODAY<\/span>\n\t<i class=\"icon-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" ><\/i><\/a>\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_2053216329\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1825748897\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1179026187\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3272644007\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Are Kiierr laser caps <\/strong><em>safe?<\/em><\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3272644007 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(255,255,255);\n}\n#text-3272644007 > * {\n  color: rgb(255,255,255);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_2053216329 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(55, 51, 51);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-936488625\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1027978543\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-1660614337\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-156170902\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1663374765\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Kiierr Laser Caps for hair growth utilize safe, low-level laser technology to energize hair follicles, promoting new, natural hair growth.<\/p>\n<p>The Kiierr <strong>FDA-cleared<\/strong> cap is effective for a broad range of individuals, from ages 18 to 88, addressing various types of hair loss, including androgenetic alopecia. For those with light sensitivity or a history of cancer, it\u2019s important to consult a physician before starting laser light therapy.<\/p>\n<p>Used by hair restoration specialists worldwide, <strong>Kiierr brings this innovative treatment directly to your home, making it accessible for both men and women experiencing all types of hair loss.<\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1663374765 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1663374765 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-861902562\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\